sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Constructor UI
  participant C as Constructor API
  participant G as Gateway Admin API
  participant P as Plugin
  U->>C: edit visual model
  C->>G: read/validate/apply permitted Gateway state
  G-->>C: typed state or problem
  C->>G: request plugin UI schema
  G->>P: authorized control call
  P-->>G: versioned schema, status
  G-->>C: redacted contract
  C-->>U: generated inspector
